      en: ["The mosque was officially opened to the public in September 2019.", "It is the largest mosque in West Africa, holding up to 30,000 people.", "The tallest of its five minarets stands at 78 meters (256 feet).", "The 30-million-euro project was entirely funded by private donations.", "It features over 10,000 square meters of marble and decorative plaster.", "The name 'Massalikoul Jinaan' is a tribute to Cheikh Ahmadou Bamba's writing."],
